  Name: B10 - Tailview
  Text: "This is newsreel footage is from the R.101 made its first flight on 14 October.
    After a short circuit over Bedford, the course was set for London, where it passed
    over the Palace of Westminster, St Paul\u2019s Cathedral and the City, returning
    to Cardington after a flight lasting five hours 40 minutes. During this flight,
    the servos were not used, there was no reported difficulty in controlling the
    airship."
